      "created_at": "2018-07-19T17:50:11.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Just a quick question. I've just been organising the box properly and I've noticed that there are no chunky \"new style\" dividers for Oblivaeon, the Mission Deck, Shield Deck, or the Aeaon Men deck. It did come with one for the Scion deck (the only one that is coloured purple) though. This seems a bit odd as there are flimsy \"old style\" dividers for those four that I mentioned, so it looks like they're meant to be there.</p><p>Can someone at GtG confirm whether those cards are meant to be included or not? Or possibly someone else who has received it let me know whether they have them.</p>",
