      "created_at": "2018-08-07T11:43:03.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I know it's a month or so later, but I was just organizing my cards in the big box (which I've taken to calling The Monolith) and I had some confusion over the fact that the Scion divider is stuffed in amongst the Environment ones, while the rest of the Oblivaeon dividers were in one of the Villain packs.&nbsp; I thought I was short one Scion divider for a while, until I got around to cracking open the Environment pack and found there was one in there that wasn't for an environment at all.</p>",
